Scheme name: pbcp

Status: Provisional

Applications/protocols that use this scheme name: This scheme name is used by the Proof-Bound Claims Protocol (PBCP), a protocol for producing claims whose assertion is backed by proof of resources spent, in order to provide a URI syntax for delivering challenges and specifying where responses are to be returned [1].

